    - character:
        name: Mousdoromo
        icon: {fileID: -2827179253996214189, guid: f324f54cb0abe2e4fba5a0eca21ed5be, type: 3}
      line: Halt! You cannot proceed. You are not yet worthy to enter this chamber.
        Follow your path. Delve deep into the dungeon and discover your true nature.
  optionalDialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Mousdoromo
        icon: {fileID: -2827179253996214189, guid: f324f54cb0abe2e4fba5a0eca21ed5be, type: 3}
      line: Step forward. You have proven your worth through blood and conquest.
        The chamber is open to you. Enter, and behold the trophies of the beasts
        you have laid to rest.
